    "code": "# Python program to find\n# the frequency of k\n# in matrix where\n# m(i, j)=i+j\n \nimport math\n \ndef find( n,  k):\n \n    if (n + 1 >= k):\n        return (k - 1)\n    else:\n        return (2 * n + 1 - k)\n \n  \n# Driver Code\nn = 4\nk = 7\n \nfreq = find(n, k)\n \nif (freq < 0):\n    print ( \" element not exist\")\nelse:\n    print(\" Frequency of \" , k ,\" is \" , freq )\n \n# This code is contributed\n# by Gitanjali.",
